  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/Pandas-Falling-Trees/blob/39450623ab70513b8b5320f3e006b9af02ad453e/assets/banner.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Баннер мода Panda's Falling Trees\"></p>\n<blockquote>\n  <p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/wjPt4vEfXb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1021703635178115122?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&label=Discord&labelColor=black&color=lightblue\" alt=\"Discord\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpandas-falling-trees\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/i2kUe4lq?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&label=Modrinth&labelColor=black&color=green\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pandas-falling-trees\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/880630?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&label=Curseforge&labelColor=black&color=red\" alt=\"Curseforge\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/PandaDap2006/Pandas-Falling-Trees\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/downloads/PandaDap2006/Pandas-Falling-Trees/total?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&label=Github&labelColor=black&color=white\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a></p>\n  <p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pandalib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/PandaLib-REQUIRED-1?style=for-the-badge&labelColor=black&color=gold\" alt=\"PandaLib\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Fabric API-REQUIRED for Fabric-1?style=for-the-badge&labelColor=black&color=gold\" alt=\"Fabric API\"></a></p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>Об этом моде:</h2>\n<p>Panda's Falling Trees заставляет деревья падать так же, как в моде <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamictrees\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dynamic Trees</a>, при этом сохраняя оригинальные деревья из ванильного Minecraft.</p>\n<p>Мод должен поддерживать другие моды, если блоки древесины и листвы входят в соответствующие теги блоков (log и leaves).</p>\n<h3>Поддерживаемые версии и загрузчики модов:</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Загрузчик модов</th>\n<th>Версии</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Fabric</td>\n<td>1.20 – 1.21.10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NeoForge</td>\n<td>1.20.5 – 1.21.10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Forge</td>\n<td>Поддержка завершена</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Разработка ориентирована на версию 1.21.10.</p>\n<h2>Демонстрация:</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/Pandas-Falling-Trees/blob/39450623ab70513b8b5320f3e006b9af02ad453e/assets/showcase_falling_tree_large.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Демонстрация падения деревьев\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h3>Разработка:</h3>\n<h4>Поиск кодовой базы для конкретной версии</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>1.21</strong><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/Pandas-Falling-Trees/tree/versions/1.21.10\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.21.10</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/Pandas-Falling-Trees/tree/versions/1.21.9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.21.9</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/Pandas-Falling-Trees/tree/versions/1.21.8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.21.8</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/Pandas-Falling-Trees/tree/versions/1.21.7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.21.7</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/Pandas-Falling-Trees/tree/versions/1.21.6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.21.6</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/Pandas-Falling-Trees/tree/versions/1.21.5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.21.5</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/Pandas-Falling-Trees/tree/versions/1.21.4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.21.4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/Pandas-Falling-Trees/tree/versions/1.21.3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.21.3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/Pandas-Falling-Trees/tree/versions/1.21.2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.21.2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/Pandas-Falling-Trees/tree/versions/1.21.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.21.1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/Pandas-Falling-Trees/tree/versions/1.21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.21.0</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><strong>1.20</strong><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/Pandas-Falling-Trees/tree/versions/1.20.6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.20.6</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/Pandas-Falling-Trees/tree/versions/1.20.5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.20.5</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/Pandas-Falling-Trees/tree/versions/1.20.4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.20.4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/Pandas-Falling-Trees/tree/versions/1.20.3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.20.3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/Pandas-Falling-Trees/tree/versions/1.20.2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.20.2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/Pandas-Falling-Trees/tree/versions/1.20.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.20.1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/Pandas-Falling-Trees/tree/versions/1.20\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.20.0</a></li></ul></li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Kotlin DSL</h4>\n<pre><code>repositories {\n    mavenCentral()\n    maven(\"<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252frepo.pandasystems.dev%252frepository%252fmaven-public%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://repo.pandasystems.dev/repository/maven-public/</a>\")\n}\n\ndependencies {\n    modApi(\"dev.pandasystems:fallingtrees-common-&lt;game version&gt;:&lt;version&gt;\") // Общий модуль\n    api(\"dev.pandasystems:fallingtrees-neoforge-&lt;game version&gt;:&lt;version&gt;\")  // NeoForge\n    modApi(\"dev.pandasystems:fallingtrees-fabric-&lt;game version&gt;:&lt;version&gt;\") // Fabric\n}</code></pre>\n<hr>\n<h2>Благодарности:</h2>\n<blockquote>\n  <h3>Благодарим <strong>Kinetic Hosting</strong> за поддержку этого проекта</h3>\n  <p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.kinetichosting.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d476\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/ThePandaOliver/blob/main/assets_for_readme/Support/kinetic_hosting_banner.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Баннер партнёра\"></a></p>\n  <p>Каждый приобретённый сервер по моей <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.kinetichosting.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d476\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">партнёрской ссылке</a> поможет поддержать меня и мою работу.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>Лицензия</h2>\n<p>Проект распространяется под лицензией GNU GPLv3.</p>",
